 face</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600">Nisha stands full screen in front of you and blinks, breathes, smiles, blushes and pouts as you talk.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-rose-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Speaks your language</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600">Urdu, Roman Urdu, Hinglish, Hindi and English â€” she matches the way you write and speak.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-rose-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Always listening</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600">Turn on the mic and say â€œNisha kesi ho yrrâ€ â€” she wakes up and answers out loud.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-rose-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Remembers you</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600">Notes, tasks and personal details live in your vault, protected by a passcode.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-rose-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Sees what you see</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600">Open the camera or send a photo and she reacts to it naturally.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-rose-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Your look, your voice</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600">Five moody themes, your own character photo, and pitch and speed you control.</p></div></section><section class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col items-center px-6 pb-24 text-center"><img alt="Nisha smiling" class="h-40 w-40 rounded-full object-cover object-top shadow-lg" src="https://files.totalum-project.com/p/nisha/01M813Z2DBTVJX22754DM1JD94.jpg"><h2 class="font-display mt-6 text-3xl font-semibold">She is waiting for you</h2><a class="mt-6 rounded-full bg-brand px-7 py-3 font-medium text-white hover:opacity-90" href="https://nisha.totalum-project.com/register">Say hello to Nisha</a><